Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ready for School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,$1,000 per capita income
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,held them back.
